Section 24 of the principal Order is amended(a) in subsection ( 1) - (i} by deleting "The external assets of the Board shall consist of all or any of the following" from the first 2 lines and by substituting "The external assets of the Currency Fund shall any of the following and shall at all times be than 100 per cent of the face value of the currency by the Authority" therefor;

(ii) in paragraph fa), by deleting "coin and bullion" and by substituting "and silver in any form" therefor;

(b) in subsection (2) -

(i) by deleting "70" from the second line and by substituting "100"

(ii) in the proviso, by deleting "figure of 70 per cent" from the line and by substituting "percentage" therefor; {c) in subsection (5), in paragraph {b), by deleting "subsection (5) of the last line and by substituting "the accounting standards adopted by the Authority" therefor. Repeal of sections 25 to 34.
